          "short": "$18\\,225=3^6\\times5^2$; $\\sqrt{18\\,225}=135$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}18\\,225&=25\\times729\\\\18\\,225&=5^2\\times3^6\\\\18\\,225&=(3^3\\times5)^2\\\\\\sqrt{18\\,225}&=3^3\\times5\\\\\\sqrt{18\\,225}&=27\\times5\\\\\\sqrt{18\\,225}&=135\\end{align*}$$",
